  "description": "Dear team,\n\nPlease find below a concise overview of the current project configuration. At the package level we rely on three core libraries: **Newtonsoft.Json** (version\u202f13.0.1), **EntityFramework** (version\u202f6.4.4, designated as a build\u2011type dependency), and **Serilog** (version\u202f2.10.0, default type). For the **net48** target framework we additionally include **Microsoft.NETCore.App** (version\u202f2.1.0, default type) and **xunit** (version\u202f2.4.1); this framework imports the portable profile **portable\u2011net45+win8**. The **netstandard2.0** framework brings in **System.Collections.Immutable** (version\u202f1.7.1) and imports **dotnet5.6**.  \n\nThe project is prepared to run on all listed Windows\u202f10 runtime platforms\u2014**win10\u2011arm**, **win10\u2011arm\u2011aot**, **win10\u2011x86**, **win10\u2011x86\u2011aot**, **win10\u2011x64**, and **win10\u2011x64\u2011aot**\u2014each with its default configuration. Finally, we declare explicit support for **.NET Standard\u202f2.0** and **.NET\u202f5.0**."
